  "result": "All 289 tests passing. The bulk discount feature is complete and fully tested. Key implementation details:\n\n**How it works:**\n- Lines with 10+ units get an automatic 2.5% discount applied after any line or tier discount\n- Calculation order: lineTotal \u2192 line discount \u2192 bulk discount (2.5% of amount after line discount) \u2192 VAT on final amount\n- Both discounts are aggregated in the `invoiceTotals.discount` field\n- VAT is calculated on the amount after all discounts\n\n**Example calculation for qty 10:**\n- lineTotal = 100,000 cents\n- lineDiscount = 0 (no explicit discount)\n- bulkDiscount = 100,000 \u00d7 2.5% = 2,500 cents\n- amountAfterDiscount = 97,500 cents\n- VAT @ 21% = 20,475 cents\n- total = 100,000 - 2,500 + 20,475 = 117,975 cents\n\nTests verify: threshold at exactly 10 units, interaction with line/tier discounts, proper VAT calculation, rounding accuracy, and invoiceTotals aggregation across multiple lines with mixed bulk/non-bulk quantities.",
